<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1124015002">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention1>
<ptxt>
If you do not select a suitable route and take proper precautions when performing a road test, an accident can occur.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Select a level road with no traffic to minimize the risk of accident.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the test extremely carefully.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the road test with 2 persons, a driver and a tester.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1124015010">
<title>
P0016
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Limit the driving speed permissible in road conditions and regulations.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTCs are not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Intake CMP sensor (P0340)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
CKP sensor (P0335 and P0336)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Intake VVT actuator (P1088, P14C4, P2614, P34AC and P34C8)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine and repeat acceleration and deceleration between 30 and 80 km/h (19 and 50 mile/h) more than 10 times.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1124015011">
<title>
P0017
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Limit the driving speed permissible in road conditions and regulations.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Troubleshoot first unexpected DTCs previously detected in “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following DTCs are not detected in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Exhaust CMP sensor (P0365)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
CKP sensor (P0335 and P0336)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Exhaust OCV (P0013, P2090 and P2091)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Start engine and drive vehicle at 60 to 80 km/h (37 to 50 mile/h) for more than 10 min with engine speed 1,600 rpm or more.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1124015003">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLSB0A1124015004">
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A1124015005">
<question>
Was “Engine and Emission Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1124001">Engine and Emission Control System Check:K14D</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A1124015006">
<title>
CMP sensor, signal rotor and its circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check CMP sensor, signal rotor and its circuit related to DTC according to Step 2 – 5 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1124044">DTC P0340 / P0365:K14D</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective part.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A1124015007">
<title>
CKP sensor, sensor plate and its circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check CKP sensor, sensor plate and its circuit related to DTC according to Step 2 – 5 under 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A1124043">DTC P0335 / P0336:K14D</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective part.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A1124015008">
<title>
Engine mechanical system check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Remove timing chain cover. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426027"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check the following items.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Timing chain, timing chain tensioner and timing chain tensioner adjuster: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426034"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Intake VVT actuator
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Motor part: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326040"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Sprocket part: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426037"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Exhaust VVT actuator: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1426037"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 5.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective part.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A1124015009">
<title>
Troubleshooting of other DTC(s) at the same time
</title>
<question>
Is other DTC(s) detected together?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to troubleshooting for applicable DTC.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace ECM and recheck for DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1326001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
